
//- Shared login form for desktop and mobile layouts.
div(class="w-full")
    //- Login heading.
    h1#login-title(class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary sm:text-3xl")
        | Bienvenido de nuevo

    p(class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600")
        | Inicia sesión para acceder a tu cuenta de salud.

    //- Authentication error.
    if error
        p#login-error(
            class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-3 text-sm text-red-800"
            role="alert"
        )= error

    //- Login form.
    form(class="mt-10 space-y-5 " action="/login" method="POST")
        //- Email field.
        div
            label(
                for="email"
                class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold text-primary"
            ) Correo electrónico

            input#email(
                class="block w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-900 placeholder:text-slate-400 outline-none transition focus:border-secondary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary/20"
                type="email"
                name="email"
                autocomplete="username"
                maxlength="80"
                placeholder="Ingresa tu correo electrónico"
                required
                aria-describedby=error ? "login-error" : undefined
            )

        //- Password field.
        div
            div(class="mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2")
                label(
                    for="password"
                    class="block text-sm font-semibold text-primary"
                ) Contraseña

                a(
                    class="text-sm font-semibold text-secondary hover:text-primary hover:underline"
                    href="/forgot-password"
                ) ¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?

            input#password(
                class="block w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-base text-slate-900 placeholder:text-slate-400 outline-none transition focus:border-secondary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary/20"
                type="password"
                name="password"
                autocomplete="current-password"
                placeholder="Ingresa tu contraseña"
                required
            )

        //- Centered primary action.
        div(class="flex justify-center pt-2")
            button(
                class="w-full max-w-xs rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition hover:bg-secondary focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary focus:ring-offset-2"                
                type="submit"
            ) Iniciar sesión

    //- Registration section.
    div(class="mt-7 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6")
        p(class="text-center text-sm text-slate-600")
            | ¿Aún no tienes una cuenta?

        a(
            class="mx-auto mt-3 flex w-full max-w-xs items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-secondary bg-white px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-primary transition hover:bg-sky-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary focus:ring-offset-2"
            href="/register"
        ) Crear una cuenta

    //- Security notice.
    p(class="mt-5 text-center text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500")
        span(class="font-semibold text-wellness") Acceso seguro
        |  · Tu información de salud está protegida.


